OL,3,ACanada unveils new $20 bill featuring
OL,4,Aportrait of King Charles
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanada has unveiled a new $20 banknote
OL,7,Ffeaturing a portrait of King Charles
OL,8,FIII, the first new monarch to appear on
OL,9,Fa Canadian banknote in more than 70
OL,10,Fyears, following the death of Queen
OL,11,FElizabeth II in 2022.
OL,13,FThe banknote was revealed at a Bank of
OL,14,FCanada event on Thursday - a "very
OL,15,Fspecial day", central bank governor
OL,16,FTiff Macklem said.
OL,18,FA unique feature of the banknote is its
OL,19,Fvertical orientation. The back shows an
OL,20,Fimage of the Vimy Ridge memorial in
OL,21,FFrance to commemorate Canada's role in
OL,22,FWorld War I.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
