OL,3,ACanada unveils new $20 bill featuring
OL,4,Aportrait of King Charles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Commonwealth nations of New Zealand
OL,7,Fand Australia have displayed the King
OL,8,Fon their coins, though Australia has
OL,9,Fsaid it will not feature him on
OL,10,Fbanknotes.
